    "description": {
      "text": "We understand that every dog is different. We work with dogs who may be nervous, anxious, visually impaired, living with diabetes, seniors, or those with other health issues. \n\nOne of the questions we hear most often is, “How do you keep my dog still?” The answer is simple: we don’t force them to stay in one position.\n\nWe work with each pet in the position where they feel most comfortable. If they want to stand, we stand. If they prefer to sit, we sit. If they feel more comfortable on the floor or on their favourite mat, we move with them. We also have a large, comfortable dog bed and a soft, welcoming tabletop, giving us different options to create a relaxed experience. \n\nFor our feline friends, we use a soft, 100% cotton towel to gently swaddle them, keeping their front paws safely tucked in while allowing them to remain comfortable and secure throughout their teeth cleaning.",
      "color": "#000000",
      "className": "whitespace-pre-line text-justify"
    },
